{"seq":1,"slug":"rope-data-structure","title":"Rope 数据结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/editor-architecture/text-buffer/rope-data-structure","wordCount":1153,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"rope-数据结构\">Rope 数据结构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rope 用「分片 + 平衡二叉树」这一组概念，把大文件任意位置的编辑从 O(n) 降到 O(log n)：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>叶节点（leaf）</strong>：存储实际的短字符串片段，是文本的唯一载体。</li>\n<li><strong>内部节点与权重（weight）</strong>：不存文本，只记录左子树的字符总数，用于遍历时快速定位字符位置。</li>\n<li><strong>拆分与拼接（split / concat）</strong>：Rope 的两个基础原语，任意编辑都由它们组合而成——插入 = 一次拆分 + 两次拼接。</li>\n<li><strong>平衡策略</strong>：AVL 旋转、权重平衡、惰性重建，用来防止树退化为链表，保证 O(log n) 上界。</li>\n<li><strong>适用边界</strong>：文件越大收益越明显（≥64 KB 起），小文件反而不如原生字符串。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要-rope\">为什么需要 Rope</h2><p>在代码编辑器中，文本内容需要频繁地在任意位置进行插入和删除。如果使用原生字符串（如 JavaScript 的 <code>string</code>），每次中间位置的修改都需要 O(n) 的内存拷贝。当文件达到数万行时，这种开销会导致明显的卡顿。</p>\n<p>Rope 数据结构由 Boehm、Atkinson 和 Plass 于 1995 年提出，其核心思想是将一个长字符串拆分为多个短片段，用一棵平衡二叉树来组织它们。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>原生字符串</th>\n<th>Rope</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>索引访问</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>Rope 需要树遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插入</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>Rope 只需拆分 + 拼接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>同插入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拼接</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>新建根节点指向两棵子树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拆分</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>沿路径拆分叶节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遍历</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>中序遍历所有叶节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"树结构与内存布局\">树结构与内存布局</h2><p>Rope 是一棵二叉树，叶节点存储实际的字符串片段，内部节点存储左子树的字符总权重（weight），用于快速定位字符位置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[&quot;内部节点&lt;br/&gt;weight=6&quot;] --&gt; L[&quot;叶节点&lt;br/&gt;&#39;Hello &#39;&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; R2[&quot;内部节点&lt;br/&gt;weight=6&quot;]&#10;    R2 --&gt; L2[&quot;叶节点&lt;br/&gt;&#39;World &#39;&quot;]&#10;    R2 --&gt; L3[&quot;叶节点&lt;br/&gt;&#39;Editor&#39;&quot;]\">graph TD\n    R[\"内部节点&lt;br/&gt;weight=6\"] --&gt; L[\"叶节点&lt;br/&gt;'Hello '\"]\n    R --&gt; R2[\"内部节点&lt;br/&gt;weight=6\"]\n    R2 --&gt; L2[\"叶节点&lt;br/&gt;'World '\"]\n    R2 --&gt; L3[\"叶节点&lt;br/&gt;'Editor'\"]</pre><p>每个节点的类型定义如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RopeLeaf {&#10;  kind: &#39;leaf&#39;;&#10;  text: string;&#10;  length: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface RopeNode {&#10;  kind: &#39;node&#39;;&#10;  left: Rope;&#10;  right: Rope;&#10;  weight: number;&#10;  height: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Rope = RopeLeaf | RopeNode;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RopeLeaf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'leaf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RopeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Rope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Rope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Rope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RopeLeaf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RopeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>内存布局的关键设计决策是叶节点的最大片段长度。通常设为 512 到 2048 个字符之间，以平衡树高度和内存碎片。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>叶节点最大长度</td>\n<td>1024 字符</td>\n<td>过小增加树高，过大增加拷贝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>再平衡阈值</td>\n<td>高度差 ≥2</td>\n<td>AVL 旋转触发条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并阈值</td>\n<td>256 字符</td>\n<td>相邻小叶节点合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Xi-editor 使用了一种改进的 Rope 变体，叶节点不直接存储字符串，而是存储指向共享内存区域的引用（CoW 语义），这在协同编辑场景下可以显著减少内存拷贝。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"拆分与拼接操作\">拆分与拼接操作</h2><p>Rope 的核心优势体现在拆分（split）和拼接（concat）操作上，它们是所有编辑操作的基础原语。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function createLeaf(text: string): RopeLeaf {&#10;  return { kind: &#39;leaf&#39;, text, length: text.length };&#10;}&#10;&#10;function concat(left: Rope, right: Rope): RopeNode {&#10;  return {&#10;    kind: &#39;node&#39;,&#10;    left,&#10;    right,&#10;    weight: ropeLength(left),&#10;    height: Math.max(height(left), height(right)) + 1,&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;function split(rope: Rope, position: number): [Rope, Rope] {&#10;  if (rope.kind === &#39;leaf&#39;) {&#10;    return [createLeaf(rope.text.slice(0, position)), createLeaf(rope.text.slice(position))];&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  if (position &lt;= rope.weight) {&#10;    const [leftL, leftR] = split(rope.left, position);&#10;    return [leftL, concat(leftR, rope.right)];&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const [rightL, rightR] = split(rope.right, position - rope.weight);&#10;  return [concat(rope.left, rightL), rightR];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function insert(rope: Rope, position: number, text: string): Rope {&#10;  const [left, right] = split(rope, position);&#10;  return concat(concat(left, createLeaf(text)), right);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createLeaf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RopeLeaf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { kind: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'leaf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, text, length: text.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> concat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Rope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Rope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RopeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    kind: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    left,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    right,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    weight: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ropeLength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(left),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    height: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(left), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(right)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><